    "articleBody": "Decorating or renovating some of the rooms of your house could be a daunting task, especially when you have a few new and modern things to add, like a painting or a slate wall fountain to enhance the beauty of your workplace. However, before you venture out to make the very first purchase of slate wall tile and other equipment, it is important to gather all the necessary information about it and make sure that you choose the right piece of slate wall waterfall of your living room, your workplace or try and gift it to a loved one on Christmas.   \t The sound of slate water features:   There are certain important things when you are purchasing the slate water fountain are the sound of the dripping water. You need to carefully listen to the sound of water to make sure that the sound is pleasant and produces a calming effect to the ears. If it is constantly playing in the background and sounds disturbing to you after a few minutes, then you might not be able to enjoy the desired effects of the slate water fountains, therefore, if you could make a visit to a shop and listen carefully and patiently about the dripping sound of the water than you should try and make sure that the slate water wall is placed at the right corner of the house and keep the balance and harmony of the sound in there.   \t The availability of electric socket for slate waterfall fountain:   If you choose to go for an electrically operated modern slate waterfall feature, one of the most important things to note is its placement. Choose a place for the water feature to secure where you could place an electrical socket nearby. Because for running water to function properly, you need a connection to help it operate without any delay. Moreover, you need to be specific about the choice of that the motor and the pump are aligned and installed uniformly to be able to produce the right pressure and upward thrust to the slate waterfall feature.   \t Maintenance:   When we say, that waterfall features are durable and reliable in nature and therefore, you need to make sure to take care of their maintenance as well. It is important to clean the slate of the waterfall panel every six weeks and remove any dirt and dust absorbed on the waterfall fountain to ensure that the motor, pump, and the presentation of the waterfall keep working smoothly.  Moreover, these waterfall features could also have added features like lightning and automatic control, but if you are using any such features, it is essential to keep a close watch on the working of the feature, and if anything doesn't go smooth, you need to get it replaced as soon as possible to ensure proper and long-lasting services of slate waterfall fountain.   \t Customizable:   When you are shortlisting some of the best slate waterfall features in the market, you have so many options to choose from. But when it comes to the shape, size, and cost of the water feature, every customer has different requirements and looking for unique pieces for their walls. However, choosing and shortlisting the best in the business may not be a daunting task when you choose to go for a customizable option.  This helps you to go for a tailor-made design, shape, and size of the slate wall fountain helping you to fix the wall according to your own requirements, and if you haven't got any such condition, then you may choose to pick the ones that have standard designs, shapes, and sizes.   \t Reading reviews:   For all those people who are stuck doing their office tasks and in the meantime renovating your place as well make sure to look for slate waterfall fountain online where you could pick some of the best pieces at reasonable prices, but before that, don't forget to read up on the reviews of the customers to enjoy the best results.",
